# Fixed 2026-11-26, defect 2856 (d-p260-mixedown), lane room-mixedown: the
# shape beside the macro, a body of the header's taking a pointer to the
# layer's function through the header's own declaration of it and calling
# through the pointer, while another group says `layer`.
extern "hero_time.h" layer
    function hero_time_wall_ns() -> i64

extern "fixedbugs-2856-a-layer-function-a-header-declares-otherwise-taken-as-a-pointer-is-told-at-the-binding.h"
    function stop_via() -> i32  #~ ffi_layer_redeclared

function main()
    print(hero_time_wall_ns() > 0)
    print(stop_via())
